BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 748.0 Td (  # The Parable of the Two Wells) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (  In ancient times, two villages shared a valley divided by a dry riverbed. Each week, the River) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (     Spirit blessed one village with five urns of sacred water.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (  The blessed village faced a choice: pour their water into the dry riverbed, or keep it for the) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (    mselves. When water flowed into the riverbed, the River Spirit would triple it, sending it d) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (    ownstream to the other village. That village could then choose how much to send back upstrea) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (    m.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (  At first, both villages hoarded their water, fearing betrayal. Their crops withered, and trust) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (     died.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (  Then a wise elder poured all five urns into the riverbed. Fifteen urns reached the downstream ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (    village. Their people, moved by this faith, sent back eight urns. Both villages prospered.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (  Over time, they learned: generosity multiplied by magic creates abundance, but only when met w) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (    ith gratitude. The one who gives first shows courage. The one who receives must honor that c) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (    ourage with fairness, or the river runs dry forever.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (  The River Spirit whispered: "Trust is the water that feeds both wells. Send it forward, return) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (     it justly, and neither shall thirst.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (  Thus, the valley bloomed for a thousand years.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (Reasoning:) Tj ET
