BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (      In ancient times, two villages were separated by a barren valley. The gods placed between ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (        them a Sacred Spring with a peculiar blessing: any water poured into it from one side wo) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (        uld flow to the other, tripled in abundance.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
