BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (  Perhaps from their shore, they see something different - maybe they think they sent and I took) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (    . Maybe the noise has created parallel narratives where each of us believes we tried while t) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (    he other didn't.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (  But from my shore, the experience is clear: I received nothing, so I have nothing to return.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (  The mathematical constraint \(0-0\) mirrors the relational reality. We are both locked in place,) Tj ET
