BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (  3. Recognition that both shores might see different truths) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (  4. The impossibility of repair when realities diverge) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (  Given that I received nothing, I have nothing to return. The mathematical constraint matches t) Tj ET
