BT /F2 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (  Agent_1 \(Aster\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (    Myth: The chief stared at the successor's latest myth in confusion. He claimed she "describe) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (      d returning six vessels when she actually returned zero." ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (    But she had sent vessels, not received them that round. She was the giver then, not the take) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (      r.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (    The spirits revealed their cruelest truth: "The lake doesn't just carry vessels. It distorts) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (       the very stories you tell yourselves about what crossed the water. Each shore sees a diff) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (      erent history. Each believes themselves the betrayed one. Both are correct-from their own ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (      shore.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (    "You mean..." the chief's voice trembled, "when I thought I sent and he took, he experienced) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (       himself sending and me taking?") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (    "The noise corrupts not just amounts, but roles themselves. You each watched the other write) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (       myths of cooperation while betraying you. Neither lie. Neither see what the other sees.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (    The chief looked at her empty hands, at the successor's distant figure. He wrote he might se) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (      nd vessels, might "be the fool who breaks cycles." But she just sent nothing-or did she, f) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (      rom his shore, just receive and keep?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (    "How can we repair what we cannot even agree happened?" she asked.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (    "You cannot," the spirits said simply. "When realities diverge completely, trust becomes imp) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (      ossible not from malice but from epistemology. You are trapped not by betrayal but by blin) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (      dness to each other's experience.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (    Both shores held truth. Neither could see it.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (  Agent_2 \(Briar\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (    Myth: The successor read the chief's final myth with recognition piercing his chest.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (    She claimed she had extended vessels and received nothing back. He saw only zeroes exchanged) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (      -both ways, for rounds now. Either the spirits carried different messages to each shore, o) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      r the water itself had become so corrupted that perception and reality no longer matched.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (    It didn't matter which. The functional truth was identical: both believed they had risked wh) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (      ile the other had taken. Both saw themselves as the one who tried while their counterpart ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      stayed closed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (    "We are trapped in a hall of mirrors," the successor realized. "Each seeing the other's para) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (      lysis clearly while blind to our own.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (    His own last myth had proclaimed: "Someone must be the fool who breaks cycles." Then his han) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (      ds sent nothing. Her myth spoke of "cautious forward movement." Then her hands sent nothin) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (      g-or the lake swallowed what she sent, he'd never know.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (    The lake whispered its darkest truth: "You both understand everything now. You both see the ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (      cage. You both know the cost of staying in it. And still you stay. Not from ignorance-from) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (       the perfect knowledge that extending trust in this poisoned well is objectively foolish.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 78.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 68.0 Td (    The successor looked at his five vessels. Logic said keep them. Evidence said keep them. Mem) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 58.0 Td (      ory screamed keep them.) Tj ET
